1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,435
In 2025,

2
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:05,903
917 billion dirhams worth of property

3
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:08,010
deals were done in Dubai.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,330
That isn't just a skyline.

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,176
It's a business.

6
00:00:12,483 --> 00:00:13,783
Who builds it?

7
00:00:13,783 --> 00:00:16,043
Companies close to the state.

8
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:16,752
Emaar,

9
00:00:16,752 --> 00:00:19,104
the city's best-known developer,

10
00:00:19,104 --> 00:00:21,456
now has a government-owned group,

11
00:00:21,456 --> 00:00:22,621
Dubai Holding,

12
00:00:22,621 --> 00:00:25,121
as its largest shareholder.

13
00:00:25,417 --> 00:00:26,627
Who buys?

14
00:00:26,627 --> 00:00:28,557
Mostly cash buyers.

15
00:00:28,557 --> 00:00:30,935
The IMF says about 83 percent of

16
00:00:30,935 --> 00:00:35,017
home purchases in 2024 used no mortgage.

17
00:00:35,277 --> 00:00:37,412
And villa prices more than doubled between

18
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:41,854
early 2020 and the middle of 2025.

19
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:45,030
It has happened before.

20
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,885
When the global financial crisis hit,

21
00:00:47,885 --> 00:00:51,320
Dubai property prices fell by about half.

22
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:53,454
In 2009,

23
00:00:53,454 --> 00:00:55,977
the state conglomerate Dubai World asked

24
00:00:55,977 --> 00:00:58,776
to pause about 26 billion dollars of

25
00:00:58,776 --> 00:00:59,605
debt.

26
00:00:59,917 --> 00:01:03,727
Abu Dhabi provided 10 billion dollars.

27
00:01:03,757 --> 00:01:04,731
Weeks later,

28
00:01:04,731 --> 00:01:07,202
the world's tallest tower opened,

29
00:01:07,202 --> 00:01:09,923
and Burj Dubai became Burj Khalifa,

30
00:01:09,923 --> 00:01:13,019
named after Abu Dhabi's ruler.

31
00:01:13,317 --> 00:01:15,987
Today the IMF warns that if capital

32
00:01:15,987 --> 00:01:17,029
flows reverse,

33
00:01:17,029 --> 00:01:19,138
or investors change their minds,

34
00:01:19,138 --> 00:01:21,541
prices could face an unexpected

35
00:01:21,541 --> 00:01:22,942
correction.

36
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:26,080
The skyline is a business.

37
00:01:26,210 --> 00:01:28,454
And businesses have cycles.
